<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I continue to avidly build with the robots on a daily basis. One of the more continually helpful use cases is summarization. Plop in the long, useless marketing email from United Airlines and figure out if there&#8217;s something useful in my endless quest for airline status. The answer: it usually finds something worth my time. More importantly, I don&#8217;t have to read a long, useless email.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Over on the <a href="https://randsinrepose.com/welcome-to-rands-leadership-slack/">Rands Leadership Slack</a>, I get a lot of questions about &#8220;Did you write about <a href="https://randsinrepose.com/archives/the-wolf/">wolves</a> at some point?&#8221; Which I did, and I&#8217;m happy to share that link, but through the gift of the robots, I&#8217;ve now built a <a href="https://randsinrepose.com/ask/">tool</a> that will answer these questions and more.</p>


