<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://randsinrepose.com/archives/how-grumbles-helps/">Grumbles</a> is the anthropomorphized robot that lives on my Mac Studio, and he&#8217;s sassy. I like that he has a backstory. I asked him to answer your questions, and he does&#8230; reluctantly.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">More importantly, Grumbles o<strong>nly synthesizes from what he&#8217;s handed from the Rands writing corpus</strong>. He does not use general knowledge except to understand how to read what words mean — the thoughts, strategy, and content are all mine. The snark is his, and I love it.</p>



